    "title": "Jacks face Nebraska in Lincoln Regional for first time since 2013 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Justin Cowart ,\n1 days ago Over the holiday weekend, South Dakota State baseball got assigned to the Lincoln Regional of the 2026 NCAA Division I Baseball Tournament which is set to get underway Friday afternoon. The Jacks will face Nebraska, who comes in as the No. 13 overall team in the nation and is the host of this tournament. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
